  m_Name: DialogueData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  url: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hli5HZp9HqQyXRmrdd8_ru4q1Pf69XGdN6vn5Fcwrpo/gviz/tq?tqx=out:json
  language: 0
  dialogues:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: CONNIE_Hello
      Value:
      - "<wave><color=red>Hey, pal.,</color>\nTest\n\xA4<wave><color=red>TestTwo</color>"
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ABBIE_Hello
      Value:
      - Hi... I'm new here. I hope everything is alright?
      - Bonjour
    - Key: MAX_Hello
      Value:
      - Good morning!
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ROSA_Hello
      Value:
      - Hello dear!
      - "Bonjour mon ch\xE9rie"
    - Key: LI_Hello
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new. Uh\u2026 hi."
      - "Hey pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t do that
        again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new friends?\xA4Not
        much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five
        if you count Esteban; though the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem neither
        does Devi to be honest.\xA4And Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of
        the bunch.\xA4All smiles and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when
        you least expect it.\xA4Again I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s
        a shark tank here and you wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go
        just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
    - Key: DEVI_Hello
      Value:
      - "\u2026What? Is there something on my face?"
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_One
      Value:
      - "Ahem.\n\n\xA4<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!sprite=Left><!wait=1><!sprite=Right><!wait=1><!drop>Backlog."
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_Two
      Value:
      - "Backlog.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Blush>Also,<!wait=0.5> I-<!wait=0.5> I hope
        you're...\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default><!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!sprite=Pissed>Never
        mind."
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_Three
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=Pissed>Hey.<!wait=1><!drop>Backlog.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Left>And,<!sprite=0.5>
        uh<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.\n<!sprite=Smile>Good luck."
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_Four
      Value:
      - TODO
      - 
    - Key: LI_One
      Value:
      - "Oh.<!wait=0.75> You\u2019re<!sprite=Glasses> new.<!sprite=Default>\n\n\xA4Uh\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Glasses>Hi.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: LI_Two
      Value:
      - "Oh,<!wait=0.5> you are here?\n\n\xA4Sorry,<!wait=0.5> didn\u2019t really
        notice you.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Glasses>I was thinking about the \n150 new-punton
        fusion.\n\n\xA4Actually,<!wait=0.5>  I could \nreach 200 soon.\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5><!sprite=Default>What?\n\n\xA4What
        do you mean,<!wait=0.5> you\u2019re not aware\nof what a \"new-punton\" is?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Glasses>A
        \"new-punton\" is <i>obviously</i> the \nequivalent of 2000 \"old-punton\"\u2026\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>I
        thought they\u2019d brief \nyou on it.<!wait=0.5> How weird."
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_One
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=Happy>Hey,<!wait=0.5> fella!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You\u2019re
        new here,<!wait=0.5>\nam I right?\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>eh,<!wait=0.5>
        who am I kidding.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>'Whole floor knows about\nour little
        newcomer!\n\n\xA4Sorry,<!wait=0.5> 'guess that wasn\u2019t the\nwarm welcome
        you expected\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Ah,<!wait=0.75> don\u2019t blame
        them.<!wait=0.75>\nEverybody\u2019s on edge lately.<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4Thought
        I\u2019d at least come by\nand greet you properly.<!wait=0.25>\n\n\xA4Anyway,<!wait=0.5>
        took enough of your time.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>See you tomorrow,
        <!wait=0.15>pal!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_Two_Good
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=0.5> pal!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Thanks for covering \nmy ass
        yesterday.\n\n\xA4Knew you were \na real mate.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Really
        appreciate it.<!wait=0.5> And you \nknow I\u2019ll return the favour.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>So!<!wait=0.5>
        Met any new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max earlier.<!wait=1>\nI\u2019d
        be careful in your place.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>All smiles,<!wait=0.5>
        and just ready to plant a dagger \nin your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again,<!wait=0.5>
        I\u2019d be wary of whom you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here,<!wait=0.5>
        and you wouldn\u2019t believe \nthe lengths some people go just to earn a
        promotion.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_Two_Bad
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=0.5> pal!\n\n\xA4Nice one the other day.\n<!sprite=Happy>Very
        funny.\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4><color=orange><!sprite=Surprised>don\u2019t
        do that again?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>But hey. \nNo offence taken.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>So!<!wait=0.5>
        Met any new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max earlier.<!wait=1>\nI\u2019d
        be careful in your place.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>All smiles,<!wait=0.5>
        and just ready to plant a dagger \nin your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again,<!wait=0.5>
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here,<!wait=0.5>
        and you wouldn\u2019t believe \nthe lengths some people go just to earn a
        promotion.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_Three
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=0.5><!sprite=Angry><color=orange><!shake> WHAT THE HELL?!</color>\n\n\xA4<b>I</b>'ve
        been in this company\nfor so f*cking long.\n\n\xA4<b>I</b> work harder \nthan
        anyone else!\n\n\xA4<b>I</b> am the most deserving\nof this whole damn floor!\n\n\xA4So,<color=orange><wave><!wait=0.5>
        WHY<!wait=0.5></wave></color>the<wave><!wait=0.5>****</wave><!wait=0.5> didn\u2019t
        I get a <color=orange><wave>GROWTH</color></wave><!wait=0.1>?<!wait=0.1>!\n\n\xA4<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.\n\n\xA4<wave
        amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5><color=orange>You.\n\n\xA4I was nice to you,<!wait=0.5>
        <wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5><color=orange>weren\u2019t I?</color>\n\n\xA4Even
        though you\u2019re a \nworthless little <color=orange><wave>****</wave></color>.\n\n\xA4And
        how did you\nreturn the favor?\n\n\xA4By planting a dagger \nin my back<!wait=0.1>?<!wait=0.1>!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>But
        it\u2019s fine.<!wait=0.5> Sooner or later,<!wait=0.5>\nI\u2019ll get what
        I f*cking deserve.\n\n\xA4<wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5><color=orange>And
        so will you.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Mark my words,<!wait=0.5> 'cause\nwhen
        it happens\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy><color=orange><wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5><b>I</b>
        will make your life even more \n<b>miserable</b> than it already is.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: MAX_One
      Value:
      - "Oh!<!wait=1><!sprite=Wink> Sorry for surprising you.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>I
        did not expect to see a new face here.<!wait=1>\nForgot you were replacing
        <!sprite=Serious><wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588<!sprite=Default><!wait=1>\n\n\xA4A
        shame. <!wait=1><wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5><color=red>She</color> was
        a fun one. <!wait=1><!sprite=Wink>Though I\u2019m \nsure you\u2019ll fit
        right in as well.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You know,<!wait=0.5> I think
        you\u2019re gonna bring \nsome much-needed life up here.\n\n\xA4The floor
        was getting pretty dull \nwith only the four of us.\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.5><!sprite=Serious>Five,<!wait=0.5>
        if you count Esteban,<!wait=0.5> \nthough the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Wink>Anyway,<!wait=0.5>
        nice to meet you! \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Don\u2019t worry,<!wait=0.5> I
        probably \nwon\u2019t make your job too hard. \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Wink>Haven\u2019t
        failed a single report ever since\nI joined,<!wait=0.5> and I well intend
        to continue!\n\n\xA4See you tomorrow!<!sprite=Default>"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_One
      Value:
      - "<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=1>
        <!sprite=ShockTinfoil>W<!wait=0.1> H<!wait=0.1> A <!wait=0.1>T<!wait=0.1>
        ? \n\n\xA4<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>IS THERE SOMETHING
        \nON MY FACE?<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><!sprite=DefaultTinfoil><color=red><!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<color=red><!wait=0.75><!sprite=AngryTinfoil>TSK.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_Two
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=Angry><wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>YOU.<!wait=0.5>
        YOU<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Shock><!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=1>y-<!wait=0.25>you've
        got to help me.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: ABBIE_One
      Value:
      - "Err<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>. hi?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Stressed>Sorry,<!wait=0.5>
        is this the right desk?\n<!wait=0.5>I\u2019m looking for<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.
        <wave amplitude=1><color=#bf42f5>NURTURING</color>?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Oh,<!wait=0.5>
        finally!\n\n\xA4I\u2019m supposed to give you this.<!wait=0.5>\nI hope it\u2019s
        all good?<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>I only just joined.<!wait=0.5> Applied
        as \nsoon as I graduated. \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>I\u2019m so glad I\u2019ll
        get to work\non the <color=#427ef5><wave>PANACEA</wave></color> project!\n\n\xA4You
        should see the stuff they got up in <wave amplitude=1><color=#bf42f5>R&D</color>.<!wait=1></wave>\nI\u2019d
        never seen anything like it.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Stressed>\u2026I\u2019m not
        really allowed to \ntalk about it,<!wait=0.5> though.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Anyway,<!wait=0.5>
        got to go back to the <wave amplitude=1><color=#427ef5>lab.</color>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Stressed>They\u2019re
        giving me a tour of the research\nfacilities,<!wait=0.5> and I think I\u2019m
        already late.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Depressed>This place is such a maze.\n\n\xA4Lost
        so much time finding my way here,<!wait=0.5>\nand still need to figure out
        the return trip.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Bye!"
      - 
    - Key: ABBIE_Two
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=HappyPostIt>Hey,<!wait=0.5> you!<!wait=0.75><!sprite=DefaultPostIt>
        How are you\ndoing since last time?\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25><!sprite=StressedPostIt>Me?<!wait=0.75>
        Oh,<!wait=0.75> I'm trying my best,<!wait=0.75>\n<!sprite=DepressedPostIt>but
        there's so much to learn...\n\n\xA4I really hope there\u2019s no issue\nwith
        my form this time.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=DepressedPostIt>My manager got
        pretty angry last time.\nHe wouldn't stop screaming at me.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=HappyPostIt>Hahaha.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=DepressedPostIt>I
        sure let him down...<!wait=2><!sprite=StressedPostIt>\nbut it won't happen
        again!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=HappyPostIt>I'll definitely fit in!"
      - 
    - Key: ROSALYNE_One
      Value:
      - "My,<!wait=0.25> my.\n\n\xA4Dear,<!wait=0.5> what a \nwonderful place to
        be.\n\n\xA4I<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!sprite=Serious> heard there
        was a lot \nof tensions on this floor.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>And so,<!wait=0.4>
        here I come to soothe \nall these troubled minds!\n\n\xA4Oh,<!wait=0.4> don't
        worry,<!wait=0.4> I won't cause\nany trouble.<!wait=0.75> Quite the contrary.\n\n\xA4I'm
        from <wave><color=#bf42f5>HR</color></wave>,<!wait=0.4> just like you.<!wait=0.75>
        My service sent \nme to help you keep an eye on this lot.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>It's
        important,<!wait=0.3> you know<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=01>.\n\n\xA4Having
        a workspace where you feel \nvalued,<!wait=0.5> confident,<!wait=0.5> and
        loved.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>And it's one I sincerely hope \nfor us to
        build together.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Eyes><color=#bf42f5><wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5>That's
        why I'm\ncounting on you.<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>This is the beginning
        of a \nbrand new chapter for all of us.\n\n\xA4<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=#bf42f5>I'm</color></wave>
        looking forward\nto working with <wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=#bf42f5>you</color></wave>!"
      - 
    - Key: MAX_Two
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=Serious><!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.5>Hey.\n\n\xA4I
        was wondering why I\ndidn't receive my <color=red><wave>GROWTH</wave></color>.\n\n\xA4And
        it seems like<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>. You would\nbe the sole
        obstacle to that?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>But it has to be a\nmisunderstanding.
        <!wait=2><!sprite=Wink><wave><color=red>Right?</color>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious><!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.\n\n\xA4So,<!wait=0.5>
        let's consider this<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.\n\n\xA4An honest<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2><!sprite=Default><color=red><wave
        amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5> mistake</color>.\n\n\xA4A simple,<!wait=0.2>
        and idiotic,<!wait=0.2><color=red><wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5> mistake</color>.\n\n\xA4And
        a one-time occurrence.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>Because if some  <color=red><wave
        amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5>stupid mistake</wave></color> were to \nprejudice
        my <color=red><wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5>PERFECT CAREER</wave></color>
        again<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Well<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.
        <!sprite=Wink><color=red><wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5>let's just say
        that I love\nthe screams of a bleeding pig.</color>\n\n\xA4<color=red><wave
        amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5>See you later.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: MAX_CONNOR_Three
      Value:
      - "[WIP]\n\n[They meet each other by chance in the corridor leading to the
        player's desk.]\n\n\xA4Connor: Hello... Maxine.\n\n\xA4Maxine: Hi, Connor!
        How are you doing?\n\n\xA4Connor: I was doing just fine until I ran into
        you.\n\n\xA4Maxine: I suppose it can't be helped, not anyone can withstand
        my charisma.\n\n\xA4Connor: Whatever... Anyway,\n\n[The player gets into
        the conversation. And it starts here from his point of view. ]\n\nConnor:
        You'll see,<!wait=1>  today is the day I will\n\nfinally have my promotion.\n\n\xA4Maxine:
        But,<!wait=1>  Connor,<!wait=1>  they only give those\n\nto people that deserve
        it.\n\n\xA4Connor: Haha.<!wait=1>  You think you're so funny, huh.<!wait=1>
        \n\nYou should think about starting a one-man-show.\n\nMaxine: I couldn't,<!wait=1> 
        I would never steal your spot.<!wait=1> \n\nNot when you're doing such a
        great job.\n\n\xA4We saw your results last month.<!wait=1> \n\nWe couldn't
        stop laughi...\n\n\xA4Connor: Keep your mouth shut, you damn...<!wait=1>
        \n\n\xA4...<!wait=2> \n\n\xA4Maxine: Oh,<!wait=0,5> Connor,<!wait=0,5> darling,<!wait=0,5>
        what were you saying?\n\n\xA4Come on, I'm sure our new colleague here,\n\n<!wait=1>
        wants to hear that.\n\n\xA4Connor: Getting bolder now are we.<!wait=1>Vixens
        like you only get this high because,<!wait=1>\n\nsomeone else quit their
        job.\n\n\xA4Maxine: It's funny you say it like this,<!wait=1> \n\nConnor,<!wait=1>
        because you might be the next in line\n\nConnor: I'm honored \"The\" Maxine
        cares about me keeping my job.\n\nMaxine: I really don't, though.\n\nConnor:
        ...?<!wait=1>\n\n[Maxine leaves and so does Connor a few seconds after. ]"
      - 
